1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
He rose from an artillery officer

2
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:04,870
to become the most feared
ruler in Europe.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,230
Napoleon Bonaparte crowned himself

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:10,090
Emperor of the French
in 1804.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,940
His armies won
extraordinary victories,

6
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:15,550
and his empire
reshaped the continent.

7
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,990
But Napoleon wanted more.

